ward and we  absolutely cannot  the hate that has risen in the wake of  Donald Trump's election we have to have  strong and well-funded independent  progressive media even if Hillary  Clinton had one we would still have  Republicans controlling the House and  Senate we would probably be ignoring the  urgency of fixing congressional  gerrymandering with the 2020 census and  Bernie Sanders is candidacy while not  perfect did show us that progressive  engagement has a major impact the halt  of the Dakota access pipeline after  relentless progressive protesting and  organizing confirmed again that activism  can have a major impact and as we get  past the despair and the confusion of  november eighth we must have a plan the  david pakman show has one and i want you  to be a part of it I actually need you  to be a part of it we've built a  successful independent media platform at  the david pakman show but the show alone  is simply not enough so we are launching  a major campaign to not only  fundamentally grow our reach but also to  grow the influence of progressive media  in some extraordinary new ways we're  gonna be growing not only the media  presence of the show but also the  activism and the progressive engagement  arm this campaign will allow us to  number one hire a progressive engagement  coordinator to organize and coordinate  progressive action on issues and  candidates that matter we are going to  organize and partner with existing  independent progressive shows to  coordinate activism and exponentially  increase the impact of our efforts we're  going to upgrade the david pakman show  studios to the next level of  professionalism including a real  professional set design as well as  professionalizing the guest interview  technology platform and we're also going  to bring the david pakman show to amazon  prime this is just a huge opportunity to  reach a much larger audience it has  significant tech and staff requirements  and its extensive enough that it exceeds  current staff capacity and we're going  to create a true david pakman show  mobile broadcast capability right now i  can basically skype into the Boston  studio from remote locations which is  very limiting in a lot  ways and to truly do remote broadcasts  from areas where activism is happening  we need the ability to edit and  distribute the program remotely and that  will greatly increase our ability to be  activists and additionally we are going  to start developing long-form interview  content with brilliant progressive minds  in-person interviews with people who  truly can equip us to be change agents  and also to teach us how to most  effectively lobby for progressive change  I need your support please look at the  perks that we are offering look at the  fundraising goal and make the largest  contribution you can you also can refer  donors to the campaign we've got a  referral contest which you can read  about towards the bottom of the campaign  page and you can use the Facebook and  Twitter buttons on the campaign page to  refer donors to the campaign that is  also absolutely huge if there's a perk  you want that would get you to make a  big donation please don't hesitate to  reach out to me through the website  david pakman.com if there's anything we  can do to engage you or people in your  network to become donors please don't  hesitate to ask because there's just too  much riding on this this is the biggest  initiative we've ever done and I'm  asking for your help to make it happen
 

